{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","max_tokens":1536,"stream":true,"system":"Keep the answer short. Use a sentence.","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Find the unique integer selector from 1 through 99 that has remainder 2 when divided by 5, remainder 0 when divided by 7, and remainder 7 when divided by 11. Work out the constraints before answering. Use get_value with the derived selector to obtain the stored value. Do not guess the stored value."},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me work out the constraints:\n\n1. remainder 2 when divided by 5: x ≡ 2 (mod 5)\n2. remainder 0 when divided by 7: x ≡ 0 (mod 7)\n3. remainder 7 when divided by 11: x ≡ 7 (mod 11)\n\nI need to find x where 1 ≤ x ≤ 99.\n\nFrom constraint 2: x = 7k for some integer k\nSubstituting into constraint 1: 7k ≡ 2 (mod 5)\nSince 7 ≡ 2 (mod 5): 2k ≡ 2 (mod 5)\nSo k ≡ 1 (mod 5)\nThus k = 5m + 1 for some integer m\nSo x = 7(5m + 1) = 35m + 7\n\nNow applying constraint 3: 35m + 7 ≡ 7 (mod 11)\n35m ≡ 0 (mod 11)\nSince 35 ≡ 2 (mod 11): 2m ≡ 0 (mod 11)\nSo m ≡ 0 (mod 11)\nThus m = 11n for some integer n\nSo x = 35(11n) + 7 = 385n + 7\n\nFor 1 ≤ x ≤ 99:\n- When n = 0: x = 7\n- When n = 1: x = 392 (too large)\n\nLet me verify x = 7:\n- 7 ÷ 5 = 1 remainder 2 ✓\n- 7 ÷ 7 = 1 remainder 0 ✓\n- 7 ÷ 11 = 0 remainder 7 ✓\n\nAll three conditions check out, so 7 is the answer.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Let me work through the constraints systematically.\n\n**Setting up the congruences:**\n- x ≡ 2 (mod 5)\n- x ≡ 0 (mod 7)\n- x ≡ 7 (mod 11)\n\n**Solving:**\n\nFrom x ≡ 0 (mod 7): x = 7k for some integer k\n\nSubstituting into the first constraint:\n- 7k ≡ 2 (mod 5)\n- Since 7 ≡ 2 (mod 5): 2k ≡ 2 (mod 5)\n- Therefore: k ≡ 1 (mod 5), so k = 5m + 1\n- Thus: x = 7(5m + 1) = 35m + 7\n\nApplying the third constraint:\n- 35m + 7 ≡ 7 (mod 11)\n- 35m ≡ 0 (mod 11)\n- Since 35 ≡ 2 (mod 11): 2m ≡ 0 (mod 11)\n- Therefore: m ≡ 0 (mod 11)\n\nThis gives x = 385n + 7. For 1 ≤ x ≤ 99, only n = 0 works, giving **x = 7**.\n\n**Verification:**\n- 7 mod 5 = 2 ✓\n- 7 mod 7 = 0 ✓\n- 7 mod 11 = 7 ✓\n\nNow retrieving the stored value:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0177s9kdv4P3Y6sF2T4Aq2Qi","name":"get_value","input":{"selector":7},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_0177s9kdv4P3Y6sF2T4Aq2Qi","content":"7"}]}],"thinking":{"type":"enabled","budget_tokens":1024,"display":"summarized","block_binding":{"prefix_mismatch_behavior":"drop_block"}},"tools":[{"name":"get_value","description":"Return the stored integer for the selector.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"selector":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["selector"],"additionalProperties":false}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"auto"}}